{"schemaVersion":1,"framework":"react","version":"v4","id":"overview","title":"Overview","description":"Define typed resource layouts, compose page states, and render React pages.","body":[{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["React Layout turns a shared page design into typed components for each resource in your application. Define the resource vocabulary, schemas, and composables once. Build reusable page chrome from those primitives, then let each resource own its content, loading, error, and detail states."]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"start-here"},"children":["Start here"]},"\n",{"tag":"ol","props":{},"children":[["\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"./installation.md"},"children":["Installation"]},": add the library and any companion packages."]]},"\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"./quick-start.md"},"children":["Quick start"]},": define a layout and render a resource page."]]},"\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"./typescript.md"},"children":["TypeScript"]},": what is inferred and which type helpers to use."]]},"\n"]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Use the guides below as you add props, states, composables, and routing."]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"guides-and-examples"},"children":["Guides and examples"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[["\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"./standard-schema.md"},"children":["Standard Schema"]},": schema integration and validation support."]]},"\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"./errors/layout-configuration.md"},"children":["Runtime errors"]},": configuration failures and how to resolve them; the Errors section lists every error for this release."]]},"\n"]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"./guides/shared-factory.md"},"children":["Shared factory"]}," and ",{"tag":"mdx:a","